---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="My Story — Oleg Gamulinskii"
  description="About Oleg Gamulinskii and his approach to motion design, broadcast graphics, and visual storytelling."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="story-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Background and approach</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">My Story</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">I like the point where visual storytelling meets a reliable production system.</p>

    <div class="story-layout">
      <img class="story-portrait" src="/assets/oleg.png" alt="Portrait of Oleg Gamulinskii" width="220" height="220" />
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p>
          I am a motion designer with experience in broadcast graphics and freelance documentary projects. I enjoy combining composition, typography, and history to create clear, meaningful visual work.
        </p>
        <p>
          My practice moves between individual shots and repeatable systems: animation and infographics on one side, templates, MOGRT, and CasparCG workflows on the other.
        </p>
        <p>
          I keep learning new creative techniques and tools, then test how they can make both the image and the production process stronger.
        </p>
        <div class="story-motion" data-lottie="loop" data-source="/assets/procrastination.json" aria-label="Procrastination character animation"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
